event: thinking
data: {"id": "f97fd2b617f34110-thinking-parallel_evidence-764", "run_id": "f97fd2b617f34110", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据结论\n\n**实体身份与状态确认**\n- **Namespace/Pod**: `aiops-case-v01/workload` (UID: `6743bbac-5908-452b-a35b-5f6327fe8a58`)\n- **当前状态**: `Pending` (节点分配: `<none>`)\n- **容器**: 单容器 `app` (镜像: `python:3-alpine`)\n\n**异常根因事实**\n- **调度失败原因**: `FailedScheduling` 事件明确指出 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu`。\n- **冲突点**: 该 Pod 的 CPU 请求 (`requests.cpu: 100k`) 极低，但调度器判定所有 3 个节点均 CPU 资源不足。这通常意味着集群整体 CPU 资源紧张，或者节点存在其他调度约束（如 Taints/NodeSelectors，虽然 Node-Selectors 显示为 `<none>`，但需留意是否有隐式亲和性或 Taints 未展示在摘要中，不过 \"Insu", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789108434895, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "f97fd2b617f34110-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "f97fd2b617f34110", "seq": 765, "ts_ms": 1789108442923, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 26.798, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v01", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/f97fd2b617f34110-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "0da3f1a5d3be417d8c605ad481582765a48c94381a8814e384828e79dbf57777", "bytes": 2569}, "snapshot_sha256": "ea651247e90871fc6f279b70cf2867f842ab4c29567f267c63753e31074e10ff"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "f97fd2b617f34110-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "f97fd2b617f34110", "seq": 766, "ts_ms": 1789108442924, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "f97fd2b617f34110-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "f97fd2b617f34110", "seq": 767, "ts_ms": 1789108451383, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.459, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1507, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | Pod 'workload' in 'aiops-case-v01' is stuck in 'Pending' status with no node assigned. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedScheduling 5m12s (x12 over 60m) default-scheduler 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod.` | 确立核心故障现象：调度器在 3 个节点上均因 CPU 不足且无抢占目标而持续拒绝 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | CPU request=100k, limit=100k; Memory request=8Mi, limit=32Mi | 证明该 Pod 资源请求极低，调度拒绝并非由该 Pod 的资源量级导致 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `status: Pending` | 确认 Pod 当前停滞在未分配节点状态，未进入运行阶段 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 中 Pending 值为 1 (1 sample); Running 值为 0 (1 sample) | 独立确认集群内该 Pod 处于 Pending 阶段，且没有 Running 状态的 Pod 可供调度器进行资源抢占 |\n\n证据表显示，K8s Event 记录了持续 60 分钟的调度失败，根本原因为 `Insufficient cpu` 且 `No preemption victims`。Metric 数据佐证了该 Pod 长期保持 Pending 状态。Pod 自身的资源请求极低（100k CPU），与调度器反馈的集群整体 CPU 不足形成对比，说明集群内部资源处于极度饱和状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n集群节点 CPU 资源耗尽 → 调度器因 Insufficient cpu 拒绝所有节点 → 无运行中的 Pod 可供抢占 → Pod 永久处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认的根因是 **集群整体 CPU 资源枯竭，且缺乏可抢占的冗余 Pod**。\n集群内全部 3 个节点均处于 CPU 资源耗尽状态，导致调度器无法为该 Pod 分配任何节点。更关键的是，系统中没有任何正在运行的 Pod（Metric 显示 Running 为 0），使得调度器的抢占机制失效（`No preemption victims found`）。\n该 Pod 自身仅请求 100k CPU 和 8Mi 内存，其被拒纯粹是由于集群资源分配已无剩余。虽然存在高 CPU 消耗的负载导致了此僵局，但缺乏具体的负载标识，无法进一步指向具体的业务应用。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | Pod 'workload' in 'aiops-case-v01' is stuck in 'Pending' status with no node assigned. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedScheduling 5m12s (x12 over 60m) default-scheduler 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod.` | 确立核心故障现象：调度器在 3 个节点上均因 CPU 不足且无抢占目标而持续拒绝 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | CPU request=100k, limit=100k; Memory request=8Mi, limit=32Mi | 证明该 Pod 资源请求极低，调度拒绝并非由该 Pod 的资源量级导致 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `status: Pending` | 确认 Pod 当前停滞在未分配节点状态，未进入运行阶段 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 中 Pending 值为 1 (1 sample); Running 值为 0 (1 sample) | 独立确认集群内该 Pod 处于 Pending 阶段，且没有 Running 状态的 Pod 可供调度器进行资源抢占 |\n\n证据表显示，K8s Event 记录了持续 60 分钟的调度失败，根本原因为 `Insufficient cpu` 且 `No preemption victims`。Metric 数据佐证了该 Pod 长期保持 Pending 状态。Pod 自身的资源请求极低（100k CPU），与调度器反馈的集群整体 CPU 不足形成对比，说明集群内部资源处于极度饱和状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n集群节点 CPU 资源耗尽 → 调度器因 Insufficient cpu 拒绝所有节点 → 无运行中的 Pod 可供抢占 → Pod 永久处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认的根因是 **集群整体 CPU 资源枯竭，且缺乏可抢占的冗余 Pod**。\n集群内全部 3 个节点均处于 CPU 资源耗尽状态，导致调度器无法为该 Pod 分配任何节点。更关键的是，系统中没有任何正在运行的 Pod（Metric 显示 Running 为 0），使得调度器的抢占机制失效（`No preemption victims found`）。\n该 Pod 自身仅请求 100k CPU 和 8Mi 内存，其被拒纯粹是由于集群资源分配已无剩余。虽然存在高 CPU 消耗的负载导致了此僵局，但缺乏具体的负载标识，无法进一步指向具体的业务应用。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "f97fd2b617f34110-final", "run_id": "f97fd2b617f34110", "seq": 769, "ts_ms": 1789108451398, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | Pod 'workload' in 'aiops-case-v01' is stuck in 'Pending' status with no node assigned. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedScheduling 5m12s (x12 over 60m) default-scheduler 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod.` | 确立核心故障现象：调度器在 3 个节点上均因 CPU 不足且无抢占目标而持续拒绝 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | CPU request=100k, limit=100k; Memory request=8Mi, limit=32Mi | 证明该 Pod 资源请求极低，调度拒绝并非由该 Pod 的资源量级导致 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `status: Pending` | 确认 Pod 当前停滞在未分配节点状态，未进入运行阶段 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 中 Pending 值为 1 (1 sample); Running 值为 0 (1 sample) | 独立确认集群内该 Pod 处于 Pending 阶段，且没有 Running 状态的 Pod 可供调度器进行资源抢占 |\n\n证据表显示，K8s Event 记录了持续 60 分钟的调度失败，根本原因为 `Insufficient cpu` 且 `No preemption victims`。Metric 数据佐证了该 Pod 长期保持 Pending 状态。Pod 自身的资源请求极低（100k CPU），与调度器反馈的集群整体 CPU 不足形成对比，说明集群内部资源处于极度饱和状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n集群节点 CPU 资源耗尽 → 调度器因 Insufficient cpu 拒绝所有节点 → 无运行中的 Pod 可供抢占 → Pod 永久处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认的根因是 **集群整体 CPU 资源枯竭，且缺乏可抢占的冗余 Pod**。\n集群内全部 3 个节点均处于 CPU 资源耗尽状态，导致调度器无法为该 Pod 分配任何节点。更关键的是，系统中没有任何正在运行的 Pod（Metric 显示 Running 为 0），使得调度器的抢占机制失效（`No preemption victims found`）。\n该 Pod 自身仅请求 100k CPU 和 8Mi 内存，其被拒纯粹是由于集群资源分配已无剩余。虽然存在高 CPU 消耗的负载导致了此僵局，但缺乏具体的负载标识，无法进一步指向具体的业务应用。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 53.1s\n├─ 问题定位: 17.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 26.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v01/workload: 26.8s (Evidence 18.8s, RCA 7.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v01/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 53.104, "metrics": {"run_id": "f97fd2b617f34110", "mttr": {"value": "53.1s", "seconds": 53.10838031768799, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 53108.38031768799, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 49882.885694503784, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 6492.141008377075, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2912.7683639526367}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17819.740056991577, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 26798.017024993896, "succes